<view class="sunset-welcome">
  <view class="welcome-aurora"></view>
  <view class="welcome-brand"><view class="brand-roll">LN</view><view><text>恋爱笔记</text><text>LOVE ROLL · FOR TWO</text></view></view>
  <view class="welcome-film">
    <view class="film-perforations top"><text wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4,5,6]}}" wx:key="*this"></text></view>
    <view class="welcome-scene"><view class="welcome-sun"></view><view class="scene-horizon"></view><view class="two-shadows"><view></view><view></view></view><text>今晚的风，也想和你一起记住</text></view>
    <view class="film-perforations bottom"><text wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4,5,6]}}" wx:key="*this"></text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="welcome-copy">
    <text class="welcome-kicker">只属于两个人的心动胶片</text>
    <view class="welcome-title"><text>把每一次心动，</text><text>留给以后一起看。</text></view>
    <text class="welcome-note">记录合照、约会和想对 TA 说的话。每一次回应，都会成为这段回忆的一部分。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="welcome-features"><text>合照与视频</text><text>一句想说的话</text><text>TA 的回应</text></view>
  <view class="welcome-actions safe-bottom">
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status-banner status-banner--error" role="alert"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="login">重试</button></view>
    <button class="welcome-primary press" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="login">{{loading ? '正在打开你们的胶片' : '开始记录我们的心动'}}</button>
    <view class="agreement" bindtap="toggleAgree">
      <view class="checkbox {{agreed ? 'checked' : ''}}">{{agreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <text>我已阅读并同意</text><text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openPrivacy">《用户协议》与《隐私政策》</text>
    </view>
    <text class="welcome-privacy">记录由你决定是否分享给 TA，旧记录不会自动公开。</text>
  </view>
</view>
